  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Development: Khyber Pakhtunkhwa Rural Economic Transformation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective is to improve the incomes of rural households sustainably through climate-resilient, high-value agriculture and off-farm/non-farm employment opportunities. This is in line with the three strategic objectives of the Pakistan country strategic opportunities programme (COSOP): (i) promoting rural poor households&#xbf; economic transformation; (ii) policy and institutional strengthening for community-led development; and (iii) building resilience for sustainable nutrition and food security</narrative>
  </description>
